  "narrative": {
    "northStar":"Genealogy data with the freedom of a visual canvas.",
    "overview":"The page feels like a calm, capable research workspace whose family visualization is the principal artifact. It demonstrates relationships and context at useful scale, then lets quieter typography explain the value. The established charcoal and green identity remains intact.",
